### Content (aligned with check + KS)

- **Purpose:** Visible data tables need `<th scope>` or per-cell `headers` associations; `tableHeadersReport` in metrics phase; layout tables (`role="presentation"`) excluded.
- **Passing / failing signals:** From `det-data-table-headers.check.js` (`no-header-cells`, `th-missing-scope`, major severity).
- **Before example:** `Srf` / `surfaces.py` pattern — `.forge-table-wrap`, `.table.table-striped`, `<th>` without `scope` (fails).
- **After example:** Same block with `scope="col"` on headers (matches `render_table` / `controls.py`).
- **Alternative after:** `Dcs` section with `.ks-chart-mount` + table using `headers="cw-week"` / `headers="cw-count"`.
- **Evidence and remediation:** `tableHeadersReport`, `missing_table_headers`, remediation via `render_table` or scoped `<th>`.
- **Related rules:** Cross-links to chart alt, color-only, AI legibility, landmarks.

### Real KS class names used

`ks-section`, `ks-section-title`, `forge-support`, `forge-table-wrap`, `table`, `table-striped`, `table-sm`, `mb-0`, `ks-chart-mount`, `data-ks-chart`, `data-ks-chart-kind`, `data-ks-chart-state`, `hash` / `data-ks-hash` / `data-ks-type` / `data-ks-name`.

